WEBVTT

00:00:02.314 --> 00:00:12.314
meez... meez... meez-ahn-plahs

00:00:12.527 --> 00:00:16.755
Everything... in its place.

00:00:16.755 --> 00:00:26.755
Put your hands up if your shell just works!

00:00:35.745 --> 00:00:39.176
CI's red at three a.m.

00:00:39.176 --> 00:00:43.165
Pinned it once, it drifted again

00:00:43.165 --> 00:00:46.117
Now the lockfile holds the line

00:00:46.117 --> 00:00:50.505
Laptop, CI, same every time

00:00:50.505 --> 00:00:54.096
Hooked my shell, I cd with ease

00:00:54.096 --> 00:00:58.245
Everything in its place... meez

00:00:58.245 --> 00:01:01.676
Give me one file, give me ease

00:01:01.676 --> 00:01:05.824
Give me one command, give me meez

00:01:05.824 --> 00:01:07.660
One file! (One file!)

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:11.250
One command! (One command!)

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:13.564
When I say meez, you say run!

00:01:13.564 --> 00:01:14.521
Meez! (Run!)

00:01:14.521 --> 00:01:16.356
Meez! (Run!)

00:01:16.356 --> 00:01:25.053
Fifty thousand terminals in the air!

00:01:25.053 --> 00:01:25.532
Say...

00:01:25.532 --> 00:01:33.989
Meez run!

00:01:33.989 --> 00:01:35.027
Meez run!

00:01:35.027 --> 00:01:45.027
meez-meez-meez-meez

00:01:53.218 --> 00:02:03.218
Meez run!

00:02:03.431 --> 00:02:07.979
Meez! (Run!)

00:02:07.979 --> 00:02:11.649
Meez! (Run!)

00:02:11.649 --> 00:02:13.245
Who pinned Node? (mise use!)

00:02:13.245 --> 00:02:15.080
New hire Monday? (mise install!)

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:16.835
Who runs the tests? (mise run test!)

00:02:16.835 --> 00:02:18.750
Where's the config? (mise.toml!)

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:19.867
nvm? (Gone!)

00:02:19.867 --> 00:02:21.223
pyenv, rbenv? (Gone!)

00:02:21.223 --> 00:02:22.979
Makefile, direnv? (Gone! Gone! Gone!)

00:02:22.979 --> 00:02:25.851
One tool! (Meez!)

00:02:25.851 --> 00:02:29.521
Before the doors open

00:02:29.521 --> 00:02:30.239
Before the heat

00:02:30.239 --> 00:02:35.984
Every blade laid out

00:02:35.984 --> 00:02:39.654
And my heart on the beat

00:02:39.654 --> 00:02:43.324
Let the whole world rush

00:02:43.324 --> 00:02:46.835
I'll be standing at ease

00:02:46.835 --> 00:02:50.824
Everything in its place

00:02:50.824 --> 00:02:56.330
'Cause I've got my meez

00:02:56.330 --> 00:03:01.037
Somewhere out there, they're rebuilding the world... just to boil water.

00:03:01.037 --> 00:03:03.830
Your flake's still flaking (flake!)

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.585
Your store's forty gigs (gigs!)

00:03:05.585 --> 00:03:07.660
Still experimental (what?)

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:09.654
Year after year (year!)

00:03:09.654 --> 00:03:12.686
Error... infinite recursion encountered

00:03:12.686 --> 00:03:15.160
You spent the weekend configuring (config!)

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:16.755
We spent it shipping (ship!)

00:03:16.755 --> 00:03:21.303
Ship! Ship! Ship! Ship!

00:03:21.303 --> 00:03:29.761
Meez is Nix for people with work to do!

00:03:29.761 --> 00:03:38.777
...so get to work.

00:03:38.777 --> 00:03:46.037
Meez run!

00:03:46.037 --> 00:03:49.707
Meez run!

00:03:49.707 --> 00:03:59.707
mee-mee-mee-meez!

00:04:01.277 --> 00:04:11.277
Meez run!

00:04:14.282 --> 00:04:16.117
Every-thing in its place!

00:04:16.117 --> 00:04:17.314
Meez! (Run!)

00:04:17.314 --> 00:04:21.303
Meez! (Run!)

00:04:21.303 --> 00:04:31.303
Let me hear you, people with work to do!

00:04:33.511 --> 00:04:39.814
Meez run!

00:04:39.814 --> 00:04:43.883
Everything in its place

00:04:43.883 --> 00:04:47.314
Everything in its place

00:04:47.314 --> 00:04:57.314
I've got my meez

00:04:58.005 --> 00:05:03.200
...exit code zero.
